# The build context is the repository root (see compose.yaml). Cargo needs
# every workspace member's manifest to read the lock file; only the website's
# own files are compiled. The product files build.rs reads for the site's
# facts are listed here too.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!vendor
!crates/bufonidae-core/Cargo.toml
!crates/bufonidae-rclone/Cargo.toml
!crates/bufonidae-rclone/src/lib.rs
!crates/bufonidae-cli/Cargo.toml
!crates/bufonidae-cli/src/main.rs
!apps/desktop/Cargo.toml
!website/Cargo.toml
!website/build.rs
!website/src
!website/assets
!website/styles.css
